ects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Seamless Integrations</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link id=\"all-fonts-link-font-geist\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@200;300;400;500;600&display=swap\">\n    <style id=\"all-fonts-style-font-geist\">.font-geist { font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif !important; }</style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#02040a] text-[#94a3b8] antialiased font-sans selection:bg-blue-900/50 selection:text-white min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-center items-center py-10 px-4 md:py-20 md:px-8 overflow-x-hidden\">\n\n    <!-- Primary Application Shell -->\n    <div class=\"max-w-6xl w-full mx-auto flex flex-col items-center bg-[#050914] rounded-[2.5rem] py-20 px-4 md:px-12 relative overflow-hidden\" style=\"border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05), 0 32px 64px -16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 120px -20px rgba(30, 58, 138, 0.15);\">\n\n        <!-- Architectural Shell Grid & Markers -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255,255,255,0.015) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 